---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <p>
      I have no interest in using any information other than to get back to you
      if you reach out via the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Collection of your personal information</h2>
    <p>
      This site only asks for information when you submit the form. The form
      submission is handled by
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Netlify</a>.
      You can read their
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">privacy policy</a>
      and
      <a href="https://docs.netlify.com/forms/setup/#html-forms" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">form documentation</a>
      for more information about how they handle data.
    </p>
    <p>
      There are no analytics or any other form of tracking, that's why you don't
      see any cookie notice either.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing of your personal information</h2>
    <p>
      I will not share any information you submit via the form. For more
      information on how Netlify handles your data, visit their
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of your personal information</h2>
    <p>
      If you reach out to me via <a href="/contact">the form</a> to get
      in contact with me, I will only use your email to contact you.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
h1, h2 {
  font-size: var(--title-size);
}

h2 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

p {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
</style> 